<title>NEW ZEALAND: La Grouw Corp reduces Evergreen holding.</title>
<headline>La Grouw Corp reduces Evergreen holding.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>La Grouw Corporation ceased on April 24 to be a substantial security holder in Evergreen Forests Ltd, reducing its holding to 4.58 percent from 26.18 percent, the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
